@startuml
title Login with RMS Credentials - Sequence Diagram
actor User
participant WebApp
participant IdentityGateway as Gateway
participant AuthController
participant AuthService
database PostgreSQL
database Redis
User -> WebApp : submit email and password
WebApp -> Gateway : POST /api/auth/login
Gateway -> AuthController : auth.login(payload)
AuthController -> AuthService : login(payload)
AuthService -> PostgreSQL : find User and verify password
AuthService -> Redis : store SHA-256(refreshToken), TTL 30 days
AuthService --> AuthController : accessToken, refreshToken, user
AuthController --> Gateway : RPC response
Gateway --> WebApp : 200 token response
WebApp --> User : role-aware session starts
@enduml